  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: N/A</em></p>\n<p>You have a mind that can track time, direction, and detail with uncanny precision. You gain the following benefits.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You always know which way is north.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You always know the number of hours left before the next sunrise or sunset.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can accurately recall anything you have seen or heard within the past month.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
